{"id":"00054","root":"uni00054_1","name":{"ja":"カノン","en":"Canon"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"カノン","en":"Canon"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-11-30","limited":false,"characterId":47,"profile":{"ja":"クラクルの細胞を持ち帰った米連の研究者が、その細胞をもとに魔界と米連の技術を掛け合わせ、強化型の獣人を作り上げることに成功。カノンと名付けられる。彼女は米連の特殊訓練を受けることになる。長年に渡り過酷な訓練をさせられ、実戦に投入され多大な功績を残しているが、生物兵器としてしか扱われていなかった。徐々にカノンは人間嫌いになり、米連の兵士や研究者たちを襲ってしまう。困った米連は彼女の首に電流が流れる首輪をつけ、命令に背いた時などに備える。クラクルよりも牙、爪の強度や脚力、運動神経は強化されて、爪や牙は攻撃の際には硬化されダイヤモンドでも簡単に切り裂き噛み砕くことができる。体毛は硬い。","en":"Canon was created when an American researcher brought back cells from Crackle and combined Demon Realm and U.S. technology to produce an enhanced beast-person. She underwent special U.S. training and, after years of harsh conditioning, was deployed in combat, earning great achievements, though she was treated only as a biological weapon. Gradually Canon grew to hate humans, attacking U.S. soldiers and researchers. In response, the U.S. fitted her with an electric collar that delivers a shock to her neck if she disobeys orders. Compared to Crackle, her fangs, claws, leg strength, and agility have been amplified; her claws and fangs harden during attacks, allowing her to slice through diamond with ease. Her body hair is coarse."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni00054_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[970,1940],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[117,234],"def":[136,272],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","60007"]},{"id":"uni00054_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1440,2880],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[169,338],"def":[207,414],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","60007","60008"]},{"id":"uni00054_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1910,3819],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[226,453],"def":[283,564],"spd":[71,71],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","60007","60008"]}],"skills":{"1