variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「カノンにゃ。オレを飼い慣らすのは簡単じゃないと覚えておくにゃッ！」","en":"I'm Canon. Remember, it's not easy to tame me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"気安く話かけるにゃ。この爪で切り刻まれたいのか？","en":"Don't go chatting with me casually. Want me to slice you up with these claws?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"米連のヤツらは、首輪のびりびりで意地悪してくるから好きじゃないにゃ","en":"I don't like those US guys—they're mean with the buzzing collar."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"んにゃっ！？　し、尻尾に触るなッ！　やめろぉ！　離せッッ！","en":"Huh!? D-Don't touch my tail! Stop it! Let go!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ん？　こっちを見てどうしたにゃ？　……耳を触りたい？　そんなの却下にゃ！","en":"Huh? What are you looking at? …You wanna touch my ears? No way!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ふぁぁぁぁぁ……んにゃ？　貴様、他人のあくびを見る趣味があるのか？","en":"Faa… huh? You got a hobby of watching other people's yawns?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ダイヤモンドより硬い爪の威力、いくらでも見せてやるにゃ","en":"My claws are harder than diamond—I'll show you the power as much as I want."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"耳と尻尾があるからと言って、ペットにできると思ったら大間違いにゃ","en":"Just because I've got ears and a tail doesn't mean you can make me your pet."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00054_1/uni00054_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"cl